 (2,250 gold) as item 2 in the Reset Teamfight Control build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-reset-teamfight\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Fleeting Time\",\"text\":\"Purchase Fleeting Time (2,050 gold) as item 3 in the Reset Teamfight Control build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-reset-teamfight\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Holy Crystal\",\"text\":\"Purchase Holy Crystal (3,000 gold) as item 4 in the Reset Teamfight Control build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-reset-teamfight\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 5 in the Reset Teamfight Control build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-reset-teamfight\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Blood Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Blood Wings (2,100 gold) as item 6 in the Reset Teamfight Control build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-reset-teamfight\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-15T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5e:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T904,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Eudora in Mobile Legends: Anti-Dive Survival\",\"description\":\"Defensive mid build for chain-control and dive drafts where Eudora must live through the first engage before casting her full marked combo.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Mage Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Purify Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Genius Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Genius Wand (2,000 gold) as item 2 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Winter Crown\",\"text\":\"Purchase Winter Crown (1,910 gold) as item 3 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Holy Crystal\",\"text\":\"Purchase Holy Crystal (3,000 gold) as item 4 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 5 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Eudora.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/eudora\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-15T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":15,\"name\":\"Eudora\",\"slug\":\"eudora\",\"title\":\"Lightning Weaver\",\"role\":[\"Mage\"],\"specialty\":[\"Control\",\"Burst\"],\"lane\":[\"Mid\"],\"tier\":\"A\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":10,\"offense\":80,\"controlEffect\":80,\"difficulty\":20},\"winRate\":51.22,\"pickRate\":1.94,\"banRate\":58.8,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"sora\",\"heroName\":\"Sora\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Eudora possesses strong targeted CC and burst capabilities, allowing her to keep squishy heroes like Moskov and Obsidia in check.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"moskov\",\"heroName\":\"Moskov\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Eudora possesses strong targeted CC and burst capabilities, allowing her to keep squishy heroes like Moskov and Obsidia in check.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"hayabusa\",\"heroName\":\"Hayabusa\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Eudora lacks self-preservation and struggles against dive heroes or Assassins who can negate targeted CC, such as Hayabusa and Kadita.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"kadita\",\"heroName\":\"Kadita\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Eudora lacks self-preservation and struggles against dive heroes or Assassins who can negate targeted CC, such as Hayabusa and Kadita.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/gms/image/8db55c33fd2a5c84822a2a6c51e1fb18.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_87b2a655b254c136dce8976e21935a80.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"16\",\"heroName\":\"Zilong\",\"heroSlug\":\"zilong\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_3bbb2c2b8a78d0d63ecd62d74048fcf4.jpg\",\"tip\":\"The range of Eudora’s second skill is relatively short, therefore it can be difficult landing hits on enemies. Zilong can knock enemies back to her, allowing her to unleash her awesome burst damage.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"3\",\"heroName\":\"Saber\",\"heroSlug\":\"saber\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/35a5d68d1704e2c4c6323abd4859a622.jpg?w=100-100-4b3f67\",\"tip\":\"Assassins should be wary of Eudora’s control skills and burst damage in team battles.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"36\",\"heroName\":\"Aurora\",\"heroSlug\":\"aurora\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/737f20a2934bbae1c5fd1b129dcbe066.jpg?w=200-200-fefefe\",\"tip\":\"Aurora’s range is longer than Eudora’s, thus she can easily kill Eudora in seconds.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Superconductor\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Eudora's skills inflict Superconductor for 5s on non-minion units hit and can trigger additional effects against enemies affected by Superconductor.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eudora's skills inflict \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Superconductor\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" for 5s on non-minion units hit and can trigger additional effects against enemies affected by \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Superconductor\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4ac316bbaf343836fdc741c84ca5da45.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Forked Lightning\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Eudora casts Forked Lightning in a fan-shaped area, dealing 275 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage (increased to 200% against minions) to enemies within.\\n\\nWhen hitting targets affected by Superconductor, Eudora forms a lightning chain with the target, gaining 40% Movement Speed during the chain for up to 1s.\\nThe lightning chain deals 10 (+4% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage over time and an additional 275 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage when it ends. If this hit lands, it reduces this skill's cooldown by 50%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eudora casts Forked Lightning in a fan-shaped area, dealing 275\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage (increased to 200% against minions) to enemies within.\\n\\nWhen hitting targets affected by \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Superconductor\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", Eudora forms a lightning chain with the target, gaining 40% Movement Speed during the chain for up to 1s.\\nThe lightning chain deals 10\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+4% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage over time and an additional 275\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage when it ends. If this hit lands, it reduces this skill's cooldown by 50%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"5s\",\"manaCost\":\"40\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_17018b4270f7fd04eb235499eb629861.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Ball Lightning\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Eudora hurls an orb of lightning at the target enemy, reducing their Magic Defense by 10 for 1.8s, dealing 300 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage, and stunning them for 1s.\\n\\nIf the target is affected by Superconductor, the lightning orb reduces nearby enemies' Magic Defense, deals AOE damage centered on the target, and stuns all nearby enemies.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eudora hurls an orb of lightning at the target enemy, reducing their \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Magic Defense\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" by 10 for 1.8s, dealing 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage, and stunning them for 1s.\\n\\nIf the target is affected by \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Superconductor\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", the lightning orb reduces nearby enemies' \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Magic Defense\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", deals AOE damage centered on the target, and stuns all nearby enemies.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"11s\",\"manaCost\":\"80\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ee8360b2b38255f04226a627561564fe.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"Damage\"]},{\"name\":\"Thunder’s Wrath\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Eudora calls down a blast of lightning on the target area, dealing 600 (+160% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to targets at the center. Then it strikes targets outside the center, dealing 300 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.\\n\\nEvery time Thunder's Wrath hits a target affected by Superconductor, it triggers a Thunderburst centered on the Superconductor target after a short delay, dealing 330 (+110% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eudora calls down a blast of lightning on the target area, dealing 600\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+160% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to targets at the center. Then it strikes targets outside the center, dealing 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage.\\n\\nEvery time Thunder's Wrath hits a target affected by \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Superconductor\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", it triggers a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Thunderburst\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" centered on the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Superconductor\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" target after a short delay, dealing 330\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+110% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"32s\",\"manaCost\":\"130\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d44b0dd173dce52af46ec6432c4ab287.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Eudora has weak mobility, Flicker will increase her mobility\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Eudora has weak mobility, Flicker will increase her mobility\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"diggie\",\"heroName\":\"Diggie\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Eudora's skills can deal massive AOE damage, so pairing her with heroes who can group enemies, like Diggie and Tigreal, will make it easier to maximize her damage.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Eudora's skills can deal massive AOE damage, so pairing her with heroes who can group enemies, like Diggie and Tigreal, will make it easier to maximize her damage.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, use Eudora's 1st Skill to apply Superconductor to enemy heroes, then cast 2nd Skill on the right target for an AOE stun, and follow up with her Ultimate for a massive burst to the stunned heroes. Finally, use her 1st Skill again to finish off the enemy.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":1510,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_17018b4270f7fd04eb235499eb629861.png\"},{\"skillId\":1520,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ee8360b2b38255f04226a627561564fe.png\"},{\"skillId\":1530,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d44b0dd173dce52af46ec6432c4ab287.png\"},{\"skillId\":1510,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_17018b4270f7fd04eb235499eb629861.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"During the laning phase, start with Eudora's 2nd Skill to stun the enemy hero and apply Superconductor, then follow with her Ultimate, and center it over the enemy for massive damage. Finish with her 1st Skill to link with the enemy and finish them off.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":1520,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ee8360b2b38255f04226a627561564fe.png\"},{\"skillId\":1530,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d44b0dd173dce52af46ec6432c4ab287.png\"},{\"skillId\":1510,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_17018b4270f7fd04eb235499eb629861.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Eudora build and counter guide for Mobile Legends. The 5-second Superconductor window, AOE combo setup, flex item logic, and the mistakes that lose games.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Eudora was the throwaway tutorial mage for nine years, then patch 2.1.47 quietly turned her into a burst mage with real teamfight reach. The 2.1.88 buff ([patch notes](/patch-notes)) extended Superconductor to 5 seconds, and that window now decides every fight she enters. She is no longer the joke pick, but she is also not free.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"eudora\",\"patch\":\"2.1.95\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-08-18\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"mid-burst-pickoff\",\"name\":\"Mid Burst Pickoff\",\"roleContext\":\"Mid\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\",\"cost\":690,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\",\"cost\":2000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\",\"cost\":3000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"},{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"assassin\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"weapon-master\",\"name\":\"Weapon Master\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/weapon-master.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"lethal-ignition\",\"name\":\"Lethal Ignition\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/lethal-ignition.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when your lane is safe enough that more frequent Superconductor setups matter more than early flat Magic Penetration.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when one diver can reach you before the stun lands and you need Frozen to survive the first commit.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy has healing or shield sustain that keeps targets alive after the first burst window.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default ranked mid build that turns Eudora's Superconductor mark into fast pickoff damage before adding late shield and HP-based finishing pressure.\",\"totalCost\":12010,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":465,\"sources\":[\"Genius Wand\",\"Holy Crystal\",\"Divine Glaive\",\"Blood Wings\",\"Wishing Lantern\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Arcane Boots\",\"Genius Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"mp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.mana\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":400,\"sources\":[\"Wishing Lantern\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Arcane Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Genius Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Wishing Lantern\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=eudora\u0026items=arcane-boots%2Cgenius-wand%2Choly-crystal%2Cdivine-glaive%2Cblood-wings%2Cwishing-lantern\u0026spell=flicker\u0026emblem=assassin\u0026talents=rupture%2Cweapon-master%2Clethal-ignition\u0026flex=magic-boots.arcane-boots%2Cwinter-crown.blood-wings%2Cglowing-wand.wishing-lantern\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"mid-reset-teamfight\",\"name\":\"Reset Teamfight Control\",\"roleContext\":\"Mid\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\",\"cost\":710,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"lightning-truncheon\",\"name\":\"Lightning Truncheon\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"fleeting-time\",\"name\":\"Fleeting Time\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"holy-c